sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant E as Editor remote client
  participant G as Game (feature debug)
  U->>E: Connect 127.0.0.1:15702
  E->>G: POST rpc.discover
  alt no answer
    E-->>U: MSG-014
  else ok
    G-->>E: methods incl. noetic.*
    loop every 250 ms
      E->>G: noetic.agents
      G-->>E: id, name, species, pos, state
      E->>G: noetic.agent_state(selected)
      G-->>E: needs, fear, health, node, scores
      E-->>U: Details panel + live graph highlight
    end
  end
